values.content:
Advise on pricing page A/B tests.

Product: {{ $json.productName }}
Description: {{ $json.productDescription || 'not provided' }}
Target audience: {{ $json.targetAudience || 'not specified' }}
Current conversion rate: {{ $json.currentConversionRate ? $json.currentConversionRate + '%' : 'not provided' }}
Avg revenue per user: {{ $json.avgRevenuePerUser ? '$' + $json.avgRevenuePerUser : 'not provided' }}
Main conversion goal: {{ $json.mainConversionGoal.replace(/_/g,' ') }}
Known pricing problems: {{ $json.pricingProblems || 'none specified' }}
Competitor pricing context: {{ $json.competitorPricing || 'none provided' }}

Current pricing plans:
{{ $json.currentPricing.map(p=>p.name+': '+p.currency+p.price+'/'+p.interval+(p.highlighted?' [highlighted]':'')+' | '+p.features.join(', ')).join('\n') }}

Return JSON:
{"pricing_diagnosis":"2-3 sentences: what the current pricing structure gets right and wrong","highest_impact_tests":[{"test_name":"short name","hypothesis":"if we change X, we expect Y because Z","control":"what stays the same","variant":"what changes","metric_to_measure":"the primary metric","expected_lift":"estimated lift and why","sample_size_needed":"rough estimate","risk_level":"low|medium|high","implementation_notes":"what to actually build"}],"pricing_psychology_observations":["specific observations about the current pricing page psychology"],"quick_wins":["changes that don't require an A/B test — just do them"],"copy_suggestions":{"plan_names":"recommendations on plan naming","cta_text":"what the CTA buttons should say","value_anchoring":"how to anchor value perception"},"what_not_to_test":["common tests that probably won't help given this context"]}
